        <mxCell id="9MYm1bHpN9P42XVpgqMA-44" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Note: Evan (Hello Interview guy&#39;s) solution is different, however I had done this design long back in Sanket&#39;s course&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;So, I will draw the HLD diagram (boxes) according to Sanket&#39;s solution only.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;However, all important technical discussions and points from Evan&#39;s solution will be disussed here in the form of points&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;This is the previous design doc for reference:&amp;nbsp;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FiDLwNE4chVf6g2P9mkOjazk0qSRx-ldQm0credyFuA/edit?usp=sharing&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
